## Part 1: NSTextView, selection {2,5} of "abcdefghij"

| edit | TextKit 1: text after | TextKit 1: selectedRange | TextKit 2: selectedRange |
|---|---|---|---|
| (a) textView.string = "0123456789" (same length) | "0123456789" | {10,0} | {10,0} |
| (a') textView.string = "0123" (shorter than the selection's end) | "0123" | {4,0} | {4,0} |
| (a'') textView.string = "0123456789ABCDEF" (longer) | "0123456789ABCDEF" | {16,0} | {16,0} |
| (b) textStorage.replaceCharacters({0,0}, "XY") (insert before) | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | {4,5} |
| (b') textStorage.replaceCharacters({1,0}, "XY") (insert just before) | "aXYbcdefghij" | {4,5} | {4,5} |
| (c) textStorage.replaceCharacters({3,2}, "Z") (inside, shrinks) | "abcZfghij" | {4,0} | {4,0} |
| (c') textStorage.replaceCharacters({3,2}, "ZZZZ") (inside, grows) | "abcZZZZfghij" | {7,0} | {7,0} |
| (c'') textStorage.replaceCharacters({1,3}, "Q") (straddles the start) | "aQefghij" | {2,0} | {2,0} |
| (c''') textStorage.replaceCharacters({6,3}, "Q") (straddles the end) | "abcdefQj" | {7,0} | {7,0} |
| (d) textStorage.replaceCharacters({10,0}, "XYZ") (append) | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {2,5} | {2,5} |
| (e) textStorage.replaceCharacters({0,10}, "0123456789ABCDEF") (whole, longer) | "0123456789ABCDEF" | {16,0} | {16,0} |
| (e') textStorage.replaceCharacters({0,10}, "012") (whole, shorter) | "012" | {3,0} | {3,0} |
| (e'') textStorage.setAttributedString("0123456789") | "0123456789" | {10,0} | {10,0} |
| (f) textView.replaceCharacters({0,0}, "XY") (NSText API) | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | {4,5} |
| (g) textView.insertText("XY", replacementRange: {0,0}) | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | {4,5} |

## Part 2: NSTextField, field editor active, selection {2,5} of "abcdefghij"

| assignment | editor still current | editor text | editor selectedRange |
|---|---|---|---|
| stringValue = "0123456789" | yes | "0123456789" | {2,5} |
| stringValue = "abcdefghijXYZ" | yes | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {2,5} |
| stringValue = "XYabcdefghij" | yes | "XYabcdefghij" | {2,5} |
| stringValue = "012" | yes | "012" | {2,1} |

## Part 3: SwiftUI TextEditor(text:) / TextField(text:), selection {2,5} set on the NSTextView, then @State set

| view | new @State text | view text after | selectedRange after |
|---|---|---|---|
| TextEditor (sel before {2,5}) | "0123456789" | "0123456789" | {10,0} |
| TextEditor (sel before {2,5}) | "abcdefghijXYZ" | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {13,0} |
| TextEditor (sel before {2,5}) | "XYabcdefghij" | "XYabcdefghij" | {12,0} |
| TextEditor (sel before {2,5}) | "012" | "012" | {3,0} |
| TextEditor (sel before {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" (unchanged) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} |
| TextField (sel before {2,5}) | "0123456789" | "0123456789" | {10,0} |
| TextField (sel before {2,5}) | "abcdefghijXYZ" | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {13,0} |
| TextField (sel before {2,5}) | "XYabcdefghij" | "XYabcdefghij" | {12,0} |
| TextField (sel before {2,5}) | "012" | "012" | {3,0} |
| TextField (sel before {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" (unchanged) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} |

## Part 4: TextEditor(text:selection:) / TextField(text:selection:) (macOS 15 API)

| view | step | view text | view selectedRange | binding text | binding selection |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets selection only: 4..<6 | "abcdefghij" | {4,2} | "abcdefghij" | 4..<6 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text only: "XY" + old | "XYabcdefghij" | {2,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text "XY" + old AND selection 4..<9 (the old one, shifted) | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 4..<9 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text only: old + "XYZ" | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {2,5} | "abcdefghijXYZ" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text only: "0123456789" | "0123456789" | {2,5} | "0123456789" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text only: "012" (the selection now runs past the end) | (skipped: traps; run with PROBE_PAST_END=TextEditor) | | | |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text "012" and selection nil | "012" | {3,0} | "012" | insertion 3 |
| TextEditor | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | app sets text "XY" + old, then (next turn) selection 4..<9 | "XYabcdefghij" | {2,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextEditor | ... then selection 4..<9 | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 4..<9 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets selection only: 4..<6 | "abcdefghij" | {4,2} | "abcdefghij" | 4..<6 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets text only: "XY" + old | "XYabcdefghij" | {2,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets text "XY" + old AND selection 4..<9 (the old one, shifted) | "XYabcdefghij" | {4,5} | "XYabcdefghij" | 4..<9 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets text only: old + "XYZ" | "abcdefghijXYZ" | {2,5} | "abcdefghijXYZ" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | (after the user's selection {2,5}) | "abcdefghij" | {2,5} | "abcdefghij" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets text only: "0123456789" | "0123456789" | {2,5} | "0123456789" | 2..<7 |
| TextField | app sets text only: "012" (the selection now runs past the end) | (skipped: traps; run with PROBE_PAST_END=TextField) | | | |
